  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GD2G!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F175e5585-45a0-4de2-9021-523a78e65148_1456x971.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GD2G!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F175e5585-45a0-4de2-9021-523a78e65148_1456x971.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>Join me and my co-host Jerusalem Demsas for the very first live edition of our podcast!</p>\n<p>We’ll be on stage Wednesday, December 9, at Miracle Theatre in Washington, D.C. — and we’re offering a discount on tickets for Slow Boring subscribers.</p>\n<p>Below, paid subscribers can find a code for ~40% off. If you’re not a paid subscriber, <a href=\"https://www.slowboring.com/subscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">upgrade today</a> for access to the code (plus you’ll get to read all the articles!).</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://luma.com/arg-lt10?utm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Buy Tickets</span></a></p>\n<p>If you’re not a regular listener to the pod and would like to check out the podcast before the live show, you can find us on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TheArgumentMag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube</a> or subscribe to hear more: <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-argument/id1842716928\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apple Podcasts</a> | <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/767fBooApaPMOKW6fYCYCb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spotify</a> | <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TheArgumentMag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube</a> | <a href=\"https://overcast.fm/p5366921-dKmkjb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=